    "description": "Anfield’s home dressing room is transformed into an intimate theatre to host an extended candid interview with Salah.  Alongside footage of key moments, he relives many of the goals, records and memories that lit up his time on Merseyside and provides fascinating insight into his emotions along the way.  He is also joined on the Anfield pitch by his two daughters to reflect on some of the most unforgettable scenes inside the stadium from the very spots where they occurred.",
